        1873,
        1571
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "On Saturday, May 20th, the UN personnel and their children will visit Coney Island under the auspices of the Coney Island Chamber of Commerce. A special express subway train will pick up the UN personnel and their children at 35th Street and Sixth Avenue, at 11:30 A.M. sharp and will take them non-stop to Coney Island. There they will have lunch supplied by Nathan's Famous and will have the run of Astroland and all its rides.",
